<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Nijmegen Guide: 10 places – Waalkade, Valkhof &amp; the oldest city in the Netherlands – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/nijmegen/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Waalkade</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come at sunset and find a spot with a view of the bridge. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/nijmegen/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>5.86251,51.84992,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. Valkhofpark</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/nijmegen/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>5.87026,51.84779,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Museum Het Valkhof</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Start with the Roman section – it explains the rest. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/nijmegen/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>5.87139,51.8466,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Waal Bridge &amp; “De Oversteek” – the 1944 river crossing</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Walk across the bridge and look back at the Waalkade – the best photo. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/nijmegen/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>5.87119,51.85151,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Grote Markt, St Stephen’s Church &amp; Waag</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Combine a market visit with coffee on a terrace and the tower climb, if open. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/nijmegen/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>5.86419,51.84737,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Old-town lanes: Lange Hezelstraat &amp; Hoogstraat</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come in the morning or late afternoon when it is quieter. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/nijmegen/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>5.85894,51.84812,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Four Days Marches &amp; Via Gladiola</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · If you come in July, book early and expect the city to be full. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/nijmegen/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>5.86748,51.84142,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Kronenburger Park &amp; Kruittoren</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Bring a coffee and take a short break here. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/nijmegen/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>5.85749,51.84637,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Ooijpolder – bike ride along the river</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Start into the wind and plan a coffee break in the village of Ooij. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/nijmegen/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>5.87801,51.84637,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
